{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4882, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1890, "text": "<i>You must have been a beautiful baby</i>"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 8051, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5560, "text": "<i>You must have been a beautiful...</i>"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 12557, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10532, "text": "<i>Fowl</i>"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 15903, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13935, "text": "Where'd you come from?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 21005, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18707, "text": "You got any plans for Thanksgiving?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 23736, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21176, "text": "Yeah. He's coming\nto my house for dinner."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 24936, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23912, "text": "Hey, Mac."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 27513, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25113, "text": "You don't mind me parking\nmy bird here, do you, sir?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 29047, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27682, "text": "It's only temporary."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 32550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29217, "text": "I'm hauling him upstate\nto my family's house tomorrow."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 35588, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32721, "text": "I take it Mr. Gobbler is less a pet\nthan he is..."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 38419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35757, "text": "Entree. Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 40484, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38960, "text": "It's sort of a holiday tradition."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 43859, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40662, "text": "We get a live one,\nfatten him, axe him and eat him."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 45465, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44032, "text": "Sounds festive."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 47931, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45633, "text": "What do you guys do for Christmas?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 50594, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48103, "text": "You don't wanna know, sir."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 55034, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52941, "text": "Shut up, turkey."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 60810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57579, "text": "So, uh, I mean, I got immunity, right?"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 64451, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61516, "text": "- Against many things, I'm sure.\n- Ha-ha-ha."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 66644, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64619, "text": "I mean, if I testify."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 69051, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66821, "text": "Yes, Miss Korchak."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 71624, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69224, "text": "Well, how do I look?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 73727, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71793, "text": "It isn't too much powder, is it?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 76726, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74496, "text": "Not if you're skiing."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 81864, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80101, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 85233, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82537, "text": "Manhattan Criminal Court Part 2\nis now in session..."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 87568, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85407, "text": "...the Honorable Harold T. Stone\npresiding."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 92278, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89878, "text": "- Good evening, ladies.\n- Hi."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 93771, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92747, "text": "Let me guess, uh..."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 96416, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93948, "text": "...sorority prom\nhad a few too many daiquiris..."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 100111, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96584, "text": "...got a little giddy,\nraised a little heck, right?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 102483, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100288, "text": "They're hookers, sir."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 106084, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103058, "text": "- Wasn't even in the ballpark, was I?\n- Uh-huh."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 107421, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 106261, "text": "You may be seated."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 110324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109164, "text": "What's the story?"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 113126, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110498, "text": "Cops busted a house over on 72nd."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 116532, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113301, "text": "Yes, Your Honor,\non a tip from Miss Angela Korchak..."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 118331, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116704, "text": "...a disgruntled former employee..."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 122670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118506, "text": "...an undercover officer was sent to the\naddress in question, partied heartily..."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 125608, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122844, "text": "...subsequently determined it\nto be a house of prostitution."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 128977, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125780, "text": "In support of which charge,\nI submit confiscated financial records..."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 133917, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129150, "text": "...an appointment book,\nand this swatch of red velvet wallpaper."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 137389, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134522, "text": "I had a tuxedo like this once."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 139989, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138226, "text": "Your Honor, I move for postponement..."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 142721, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140161, "text": "...pending the location\nof the owner of the building."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 147197, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 142897, "text": "Yes, a warrant has been issued for the\nmadam of the house, a Miss Irene Danbury."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 148528, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147368, "text": "Hey, I know her."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 152366, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150171, "text": "Well, I mean,\nshe's sort of famous, isn't she?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 154603, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152874, "text": "<i>I saw her on Merv.</i>"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 160009, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154776, "text": "Yeah. I think it was his salute\nto mattresses."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 163617, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160682, "text": "I read an article about her\nin one of those financial magazines."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 165753, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163785, "text": "The Mogul Madam,\nI believe they called her."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 169481, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165920, "text": "Well, Miss Danbury is famous for being\na respected member of the community..."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 171682, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 169657, "text": "...and a generous patron of the arts."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 172986, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171860, "text": "Yes, the Arts."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 175561, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173161, "text": "- The Bobs, the Teds, the...\nYeah."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 179494, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176297, "text": "Regardless, we're just spinning our wheels\ntill Miss Danbury arrives."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 183967, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179667, "text": "So let's put the ladies on the back burner,\nSelma, and we'll move along."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 185470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184139, "text": "Next case."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 188603, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185907, "text": "- Come on, girls, let's hustle.\n- Ha-ha."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 191404, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188776, "text": "If you think you're up to it. Ha-ha-ha."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 195242, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191579, "text": "Honey, I was up to it and went beyond it."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 197050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195583, "text": "What's beyond it?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 202513, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197519, "text": "Rest, honey.\nDecades and decades of rest."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 246956, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244465, "text": "Hey, turkey."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 250134, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248269, "text": "Turkey."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 252863, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250872, "text": "Want a CornNut?"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 256671, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253508, "text": "CornNut. Num-num."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 263382, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259981, "text": "Mmm. Nacho cheese."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 266350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264052, "text": "Hey, you better be careful with him."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 271817, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266754, "text": "- You don't mind me feeding him, do you?\n- Oh, no. Please do."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 273824, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271993, "text": "What's his name?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 276429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273995, "text": "- I don't know.\n- He's gotta have a name."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 280295, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276598, "text": "Oh? Well, how about, uh..."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 282497, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280768, "text": "Protein."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 286969, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284205, "text": "Protein? That's a funny name for a pet."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 294812, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293481, "text": "You're not gonna kill him?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 299050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295717, "text": "No, it's my sister's turn."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 304788, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 301990, "text": "Come on, Bull, judge wants to start up."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 307592, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305727, "text": "Know what he's gonna do\nwith that turkey?"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 312062, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307762, "text": "Hey, as long\nas they're consenting adults."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 320164, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319140, "text": "Hi, judge."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 322366, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320341, "text": "Anything disgusting\nand newsworthy tonight?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 326575, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324812, "text": "Go away, Craven, I hate you..."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 328613, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326748, "text": "...you're scum."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 333642, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330184, "text": "Did you know it's been three weeks\nsince somebody's been thrown off a roof?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 335686, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333821, "text": "What's happening to this city?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 337688, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335857, "text": "- Bull alert.\n- Huh?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 340885, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339861, "text": "Uh... Ahem."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 344498, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341062, "text": "Look, you see, I really have to go,\nbecause my car is double-parked..."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 347157, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344666, "text": "...in a handicap zone."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 350668, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347335, "text": "I could arrange it\nso you could park there legally."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 360675, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359447, "text": "Thank you, gentlemen."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 362611, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360848, "text": "You've both been very kind."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 364217, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362784, "text": "It was my pleasure."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 367149, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364385, "text": "I wish everyone was as easy."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 370981, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368990, "text": "Carlene, sit up straight."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 373525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371159, "text": "Tracy, get rid of the gum, please."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 375418, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373928, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 378790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377198, "text": "<i>Thanks.</i>"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 380961, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379300, "text": "Miss Danbury, Billie Young."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 383933, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381135, "text": "Oh, yes, you worked for me\na couple of years ago, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 386604, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384238, "text": "Uh... No. I'm a defense attorney."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 389902, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386774, "text": "Oh, pity. You look\nlike you got the right stuff."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 392546, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390078, "text": "Oh, thanks. I mean..."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 394614, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392714, "text": "Oh, Miss Young."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 396841, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394782, "text": "This way, Miss Danbury."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 399717, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397852, "text": "- Hi there.\nHello."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 401684, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 399887, "text": "Are you my judge?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 405048, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403524, "text": "Sir?"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 408290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406060, "text": "Why don't you go get your files, Billie?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 410158, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408463, "text": "Why don't I?"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 415969, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410531, "text": "So, um, Harry, I understand\nthere's been a little misunderstanding..."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 419800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416137, "text": "...concerning the, uh,\nhostesses at my social club."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 421305, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419974, "text": "Social club?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 426675, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421476, "text": "Well, yes, my establishment is really\njust a gathering place for lonely gentlemen."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 429908, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426848, "text": "Out-of-town visitors\nwho merely wish to relax..."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 432951, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430084, "text": "...and have a pleasant conversation\nwith a friendly face."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 435049, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433388, "text": "Sounds like the USO."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 439185, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436557, "text": "We have better donuts."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 442996, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441028, "text": "I bet."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 446266, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443798, "text": "- Miss Young, is the defense ready?\n- Ready, sir."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 448698, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446434, "text": "Do the people\nhave an opening statement?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 454638, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448870, "text": "\"I trembled with schoolgirl anticipation\nas he pulled me onto the sofa."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 457801, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454809, "text": "And the hand which had once waved\nto cheering crowds..."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 461278, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457979, "text": "...now caressed my naked thigh.\""}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 465041, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462049, "text": "One of your better efforts, Mr. Fielding."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 468385, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466087, "text": "Wait a minute, I wrote that."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 470183, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468556, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 474727, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470358, "text": "Your Honor, it's a private memoir\nthat has nothing to do with this case."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 479230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474896, "text": "Yo, Your Honor, the people beg to differ,\nand wish to submit into evidence..."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 483837, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479400, "text": "...the unabridged and thoroughly\nunadulterated diary of Miss Irene Danbury."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 487470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485206, "text": "All right, hose down, people."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 489371, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487642, "text": "- Object.\n- I object."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 491136, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489544, "text": "- On what grounds?\n- On what grounds?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 492939, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491312, "text": "- It's personal.\n- It's personal."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 497643, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494048, "text": "Your Honor, I haven't even\nhad the chance to read that yet."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 501550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497819, "text": "I'm gonna sustain that, at least temporarily,\nuntil we've had some copies made..."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 504122, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501722, "text": "...and you and I have had a chance\nto take a gander."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 505691, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504292, "text": "We'll take five, people."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 507327, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505860, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 509929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507495, "text": "Read it with someone you love."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 526774, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524579, "text": "Would you try something like that?"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 529673, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528149, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 531649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530284, "text": "You decent, sir?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 533753, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531819, "text": "Come on in, Dan."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 536050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534856, "text": "What can I do for you?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 538522, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536224, "text": "- You done with that yet?\n- Just about."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 540661, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538693, "text": "- This is really something, huh?\n- Oh."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 544787, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540828, "text": "I will never be able to look at chandeliers\nthe same way again."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 547494, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545333, "text": "Or the All-Star Game."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 550296, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547668, "text": "Harry, there are some big,\nbig people in there."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 554237, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550471, "text": "Athletes, politicians,\ncaptains of industry."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 558777, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554408, "text": "We could have a field day dragging\ntheir good names through the mud."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 561847, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558946, "text": "And so close to the holidays."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 566147, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 562416, "text": "And perhaps we could further\nour own careers in the process, eh, Dan?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 570120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566821, "text": "Oh, Harry, it's so right."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 572648, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571158, "text": "- Your Honor?\n- Come in."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 575159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572827, "text": "Hi.\n- Oh, hi."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 578430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575563, "text": "Oh, I like your bird."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 582060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580468, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 584695, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583671, "text": "Thanks."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 587238, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584872, "text": "If I may cite some precedence\nregarding the case..."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 589672, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587408, "text": "I'll listen to formal arguments\nin court, Billie."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 592711, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589844, "text": "Besides, I haven't even finished\nthe document in question yet."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 595474, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592880, "text": "The ending is predictable, sir."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 599484, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595650, "text": "- That will be all, Mr. Prosecutor.\n- Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 602614, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601022, "text": "Awesome."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 607284, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605726, "text": "Ladies, if you'll excuse me?"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 610925, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 607728, "text": "Sir, could I have a moment\nalone with you, please?"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 612827, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611098, "text": "Well, Miss Danbury, I'm afraid..."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 615764, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613000, "text": "Well, if you're afraid..."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 619132, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617471, "text": "I suppose I can spare a moment."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 621241, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619307, "text": "Thank you, sir."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 623911, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621943, "text": "I'll meet you in court."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 627443, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625179, "text": "- So, what can I do for you, Miss Danbury?\n- Your..."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 630215, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628816, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 641318, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639293, "text": "Your Honor, I want my diary back."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 644953, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641495, "text": "I'm afraid that's a legal decision\nthat I have not made yet."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 648829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645132, "text": "Look, that diary\nis not just a bunch of papers."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 650470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649003, "text": "It's a part of me."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 653630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650638, "text": "It's everything I've been my whole life,\nthe good and the bad."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 655469, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653808, "text": "I understand that, Miss Danbury."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 658307, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656077, "text": "This could hurt a lot of people."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 660242, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658479, "text": "People who trusted me."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 665078, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660414, "text": "People who just needed a break\nfrom the pressures of being somebody."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 667386, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665486, "text": "I appreciate your sense of integrity."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 668783, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667555, "text": "You can fine me."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 670890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668956, "text": "I'll even go to jail. I don't care."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 673520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671359, "text": "I'm afraid that\nis not your decision to make."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 680099, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673694, "text": "You see, there's a lot of material in here\nthat may be construed as incriminating."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 684770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682336, "text": "Have you read the chapter\nabout the famous architect?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 688841, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684939, "text": "No. I'm just up to the\n'76 convention. Oof."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 691837, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689744, "text": "I think you'll enjoy it when you get to it."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 694072, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692013, "text": "Well, listen, Miss Danbury,\nI'm not a voyeur."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 696614, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694248, "text": "I'm just doing my job."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 700881, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697184, "text": "He came to me\njust after his wife's accident."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 703790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701322, "text": "He was very much in love with her."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 707694, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705226, "text": "But we all have needs."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 708886, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707862, "text": "And so did he."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 712222, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710231, "text": "He just cried most of the time, anyway..."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 716837, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712400, "text": "...and after a while,\nI even stopped accepting money."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 723375, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717505, "text": "The point is, Harry, he loved her then,\nhe loves her now."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 726506, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723878, "text": "Please, don't betray his trust in me."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 731485, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729517, "text": "Your Honor, everybody's ready to go."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 733449, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731652, "text": "Thanks, Selma."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 736186, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733854, "text": "I appreciate your allowing me\nthese few moments."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 737784, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736590, "text": "It was my pleasure."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 740685, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739093, "text": "You have a wonderful judge there."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 742328, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740861, "text": "Cigarette?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 743793, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742496, "text": "No, thanks."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 746125, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743964, "text": "Just checking."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 757003, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754375, "text": "I have reviewed the material in question."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 761079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758679, "text": "And as it's clearly germane\nto the case before me..."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 765150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761248, "text": "...I rule for the people, and I will allow\nthis document entered into evidence."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 769489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766520, "text": "But first, we will take a dinner break."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 772490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769657, "text": "Court will reconvene in one hour."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 774457, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772660, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 790804, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789610, "text": "I got you some coffee."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 793208, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790978, "text": "Oh, thank you, Billie."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 796474, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793380, "text": "Look, I'm really sorry. I should've\ncome up with something better."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 798914, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796650, "text": "Oh, that's okay. You did your best."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 801054, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799086, "text": "That's all I expect from any of my girls."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 805058, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802590, "text": "Well, look, this thing isn't over yet."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 807894, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805926, "text": "I'll be back in court."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 818637, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816737, "text": "You know,\nI thought she would never leave."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 821001, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818806, "text": "- My name's Craven, from...\n- I don't wanna talk."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 823803, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821175, "text": "My paper has authorized me\nto offer you a sum of money..."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 827004, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823978, "text": "...for the exclusive serialization rights\nto your life story."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 828910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827181, "text": "And I don't usually pay for it."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 834179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832086, "text": "You must be very lonely."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 836349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834722, "text": "Well, yes. Uh..."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 838456, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837091, "text": "Get lost, Craven."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 842118, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838626, "text": "- No, I wanna hear it from her.\n- Get lost, Craven."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 844127, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842296, "text": "Enough said."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 849793, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848235, "text": "Starting already, huh?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 851403, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 849970, "text": "Yeah, starting already."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 855031, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852540, "text": "You know, Irene, I had no choice."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 857234, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855209, "text": "The law is very clear in the matter."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 859810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858479, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 864779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862049, "text": "Sometimes I wish\nI'd stuck with the accordion."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 868046, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864952, "text": "I could be annoying people\nat a wedding now."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 870485, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868722, "text": "We all make our beds."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 872558, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870658, "text": "You got a nifty way with words, Irene."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 876428, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874028, "text": "I have to. I do a lot of talking."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 878861, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876597, "text": "That's all most of our clients\nwant to do, anyway."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 880159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879033, "text": "- Really?\n- Sure."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 882427, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880334, "text": "They talk about their wives and kids."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 885200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882970, "text": "They ask advice about things."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 887340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885372, "text": "\"What should I do about my job?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 889169, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887508, "text": "How can I improve my appearance?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 892039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889343, "text": "Should I drop out of the primaries?\""}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 893703, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892213, "text": "Sounds fascinating."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 896441, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893881, "text": "I can remember this Air Force general,\nfour stars..."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 898517, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896617, "text": "...although personally\nI'd only give him two."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 899914, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898686, "text": "The guy on page 48?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 904648, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901622, "text": "Oh, I'm good with phone numbers too."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 909592, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905326, "text": "Yeah, he used to come up every Sunday\nwith this cute little attaché case..."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 914393, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 909763, "text": "...handcuffed to his wrist, and all he ever\nwanted to talk about was his bombers."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 916001, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914568, "text": "Bombers? What bombers?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 919731, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916170, "text": "Oh, I don't know,\nit was the B-54 this, the C-31 that."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 922273, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919907, "text": "I think there were a bunch of F-1 s too."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 924536, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922443, "text": "Bombers. That's it."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 926680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924712, "text": "I gotta go. Bye."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 931975, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929984, "text": "When you're done, you're done."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 942691, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939927, "text": "Come on, heel, Skip, heel."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 945894, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944632, "text": "Attaboy."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 947294, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946066, "text": "You're very good with him."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 948992, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947468, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 951366, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949637, "text": "Sit."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 954941, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952973, "text": "Still working on that one."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 956740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955409, "text": "I have a pet bat."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 958401, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956911, "text": "We keep the same hours."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 966482, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964218, "text": "Uh, actually, Skippy's not my pet."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 968121, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966654, "text": "He's gonna be somebody's dinner."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 970050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968856, "text": "Oh..."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 972590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970224, "text": "Poor little fuzzy buzzard."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 974751, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972760, "text": "Oh, I'll be okay."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 978956, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977932, "text": "Come on, Skippy."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 981294, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979133, "text": "Walkies, walkies."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 982958, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981468, "text": "Walkies."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 984866, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983137, "text": "Come on, Fielding, what's the holdup?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 986768, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985039, "text": "- Got an 11:00 deadline.\n- Yeah, me too."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 989000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986941, "text": "Gentlemen, Judge Stone\nwill be out soon."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 992236, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989176, "text": "In the meantime, I'd be glad to answer\nany more of your questions."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 993744, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992413, "text": "Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 999079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993914, "text": "Aren't you the one that ran for city council\nlast year against the dead guy and lost?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1005287, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002022, "text": "No, no, no. That was Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1007017, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005459, "text": "- Oh.\n- Excuse me."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1012930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011065, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1016227, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013667, "text": "Manhattan Criminal Court Part 2\nis now in session..."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1019338, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016403, "text": "...the Honorable Harold T. Stone\npresiding."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1024569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022977, "text": "You look a little nervous, sir."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1027509, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024745, "text": "Bombers, Mac, bombers."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1030241, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1027681, "text": "I'm sure they're ours, sir."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1032351, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030918, "text": "You may be seated."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1035178, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033187, "text": "Your Honor,\nthe people are ready to proceed."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1037881, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1035356, "text": "Your Honor, before we begin,\nthe defense asks..."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1041585, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038058, "text": "...that you reconsider your decision\non Miss Danbury's private papers."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1044390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041762, "text": "I mean, surely you can\nappreciate the confidentiality..."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1048331, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044565, "text": "...as in lawyer-client privilege,\nas well as doctor-patient, priest-penitent..."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1051403, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048502, "text": "Uh, Your Honor, while the people\ncertainly respect the sanctity..."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1055303, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051572, "text": "...of the bimbo-bimbee relationship..."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1059674, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055476, "text": "...we heartily agree\nwith the ruling you already made."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1062815, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060347, "text": "Let's proceed, huh, people?"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1069914, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064351, "text": "Now, uh, in considering this case,\nI did some research into diaries."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1073389, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070090, "text": "There is, of course,\nthe diary of Anne Frank..."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1076688, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073560, "text": "...the diary of Roderick,\nLast of the Goths..."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1077853, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076864, "text": "...uh..."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1081661, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078032, "text": "...the, uh, Guadalcanal Diary..."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1084770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081835, "text": "<i>...uh, the Diary of a Teenage Hitchhiker...</i>"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1088772, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084938, "text": "Your Honor, with all due respect,\nwe have a backlog of cases building up."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1090906, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089143, "text": "Point well taken, Mr. Prosecutor."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1095174, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091078, "text": "<i>And it was\nPortrait of a Teenage Hitchhiker.</i>"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1097410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095783, "text": "- Well, then, let's proceed.\n- Indeed."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1099211, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1097584, "text": "Now, Your Honor, the people would..."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1101980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099386, "text": "Hey. Hi, guys. Over here."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1107858, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104058, "text": "Judge Stone? Major Roy Pritchard,\nUnited States Air Force Intelligence."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1110326, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108028, "text": "Good to see you. Hey, great hat."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1112465, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1110497, "text": "- Beg your pardon?\n- This will take a minute."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1116262, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112633, "text": "You folks can murmur excitedly\namongst yourselves."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1119636, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117771, "text": "Do you know this Air Force joker?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1121702, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120007, "text": "A major? Ha."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1123775, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121875, "text": "You've got to be kidding."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1128007, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125379, "text": "Folks, I have an announcement."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1131080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128816, "text": "Having briefly reviewed excerpts\nfrom the diary..."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1133811, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131251, "text": "...Major Pritchard\nhas made a preliminary judgment..."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1137980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133987, "text": "...that disclosure of said diary could pose\na threat to national-security interests..."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1143027, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138158, "text": "...and so has temporarily classified\nthe document and its copies as secret."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1145722, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143197, "text": "You may react briefly."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1147890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1146400, "text": "Your Honor, what does this mean?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1149763, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148068, "text": "It means I'll take that."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1151996, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149937, "text": "This is mine."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1153434, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152172, "text": "Dan, give him the book."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1159875, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157077, "text": "- Defense will surrender her copy.\n- With pleasure, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1163813, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160047, "text": "And may I remind both of you,\npending the final decision in this matter..."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1167784, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163984, "text": "...you will not discuss, disclose,\nor in any way disseminate the contents..."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1171015, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167955, "text": "...of this document,\nunder the severe penalty of law."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1174160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171191, "text": "- What...? Your Honor, I object.\n- Overruled."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1175693, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1174328, "text": "- Exception.\n- Noted."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1178627, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175863, "text": "- Frustration.\n- Vented."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1182601, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180701, "text": "- Good evening, Your Honor.\nThanks, major."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1184327, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182769, "text": "Ma'am."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1185904, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184505, "text": "Counselor."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1191937, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189810, "text": "All right, people, that's enough."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1196412, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192112, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor, do you have any\nother evidence to present in this case?"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1199143, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196583, "text": "Yeah. I got that boring stuff."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1204250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1200621, "text": "The financial reports, the police records."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1206892, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204424, "text": "I respectfully submit them."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1208152, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207060, "text": "Miss Young?"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1210760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208929, "text": "You are terrific."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1216593, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211565, "text": "I mean, Your Honor, the defense has\nnothing more and moves for a finding."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1219998, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217404, "text": "The court finds the defendant\nguilty as charged."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1223041, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220174, "text": "Thirty days suspended and a $500 fine."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1224677, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223210, "text": "And the court is adjourned."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1226039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224845, "text": "Wow!"}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1228340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226213, "text": "We won."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1235645, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231185, "text": "Don't ever touch me\nwithout a note from your doctor."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1241921, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240260, "text": "Harry?"}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1246022, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244031, "text": "Do I give you the $500?"}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1248957, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246466, "text": "That'd be a switch, wouldn't it?"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1251435, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250070, "text": "I think you're worth it."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1255507, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253073, "text": "Well, you just pay the clerk downstairs."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1260104, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258512, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1262908, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260781, "text": "I hope I never see you again."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1264812, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263083, "text": "I mean, at least not here."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1267585, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265185, "text": "Oh, no, I'm thinking of retiring."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1270848, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267754, "text": "The social-club business\njust ain't what it used to be."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1272252, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271024, "text": "Glad to hear it."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1274189, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272426, "text": "Maybe I'll move upstate."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1278229, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274361, "text": "I've had my eye on this little country inn\nnear West Point."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1279831, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278398, "text": "Good luck."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1283326, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280300, "text": "You know, this may be a little cliché..."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1287837, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283503, "text": "...but I think\nif I had met you 20 years ago..."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1290568, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288008, "text": "...my life would've turned out\na lot differently."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1292975, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291144, "text": "Mine too."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1296312, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294014, "text": "I was 14."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1300010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297951, "text": "Good night, Harry."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1306153, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303457, "text": "Good night, Irene."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1309061, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307628, "text": "She's quite a gal, isn't she?"}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1314725, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312666, "text": "Is this real wood?"}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1317761, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316169, "text": "Um..."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1323599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322075, "text": "So happy Thanksgiving, everybody."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1325301, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323777, "text": "- Right.\n- Happy Thanksgiving."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1327777, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325479, "text": "Yeah, gobble, gobble."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1331213, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1327948, "text": "Oh, Dan, you're not still sore\nabout that gag order, are you?"}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1337346, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331385, "text": "No, no, no. But, you know,\na filthy mind is a terrible thing to waste."}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1341189, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338959, "text": "Hey, Mac.\n- Good evening, folks."}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1344196, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341728, "text": "What, uh, Bull's out\nwalking my bird again?"}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1345388, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344364, "text": "I don't know."}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1348090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345565, "text": "He took Skippy up on the roof."}
{"cue": 393, "end_ms": 1351203, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348268, "text": "- What?\n- He said he was gonna set him free."}
{"cue": 394, "end_ms": 1352804, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351371, "text": "Set him free?"}
{"cue": 395, "end_ms": 1355840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352973, "text": "Hey, man, turkeys don't fly."}
{"cue": 396, "end_ms": 1359809, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356009, "text": "I knew there was something\nI wanted to tell him."}
{"cue": 397, "end_ms": 1382367, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377998, "text": "Runnies, runnies, runnies."}
